(LEGAL-008 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Tamil Nadu Panchayats Act, 1994 \(Act 21 of 1994\)  Section 133 Maintenance ) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Block Development Officer \(BDO - Village Panchayats\) & Panchayat President) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Section 133\(1\) \(Panchayat Union Minor Irrigation Tanks\)) Tj T*
(Minor irrigation tanks with an ayacut below 40 hectares \(100 acres\) not under WRD) Tj T*
(control vest in the Panchayat Union Council for protection, bund maintenance, and) Tj T*
(auction of fishery/usufruct rights.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Section 131\(2\) \(Duty to Remove Obstructions in Public Water Sources\)) Tj T*
(It is the statutory duty of the Village Panchayat Executive Authority and Block) Tj T*
(Development Officer to initiate immediate action with the Revenue Tahsildar to) Tj T*
(remove encroachments in village ooranis, kulams, and minor irrigation tanks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
